250
00:17:46,160 --> 00:17:51,300
And if a robot can go anywhere, then it can help us significantly in situations like search and rescue,

251
00:17:51,720 --> 00:17:56,220
to find people in earthquakes, fires, or collapsed buildings.

252
00:17:57,280 --> 00:18:02,440
The gecko can scale nearly any surface without glues or suction, including glass.

253
00:18:03,500 --> 00:18:08,300
An animal this size we've had already run up this wall at a meter per second.

254
00:18:08,301 --> 00:18:11,900
And when they do that, they can take 30 steps in that one second

255
00:18:11,901 --> 00:18:16,600
and attach their feet in just a few milliseconds

256
00:18:16,601 --> 00:18:19,100
and detach them at the same rate.

257
00:18:19,980 --> 00:18:23,000
No other creature attaches and detaches so rapidly.

258
00:18:23,820 --> 00:18:26,200
And that extreme power led to a stunning discovery.

259
00:18:28,540 --> 00:18:32,020
When you look at their feet, you see something very unusual.

