00:18:36,261 --> 00:18:39,700
And these structures have millions of hairs on them.

262
00:18:39,701 --> 00:18:45,400
And each hair has about 100 to 1,000 split ends on it,

263
00:18:45,401 --> 00:18:48,300
so the worst case of split ends possible in some species.

264
00:18:48,301 --> 00:18:50,500
And those split ends are very small.

265
00:18:50,501 --> 00:18:52,940
They can be just a couple hundred nanometers.

266
00:18:52,941 --> 00:18:57,080
These split ends are 500 times smaller than a human hair.

267
00:18:57,081 --> 00:19:01,920
And so minuscule, they penetrate the molecular structure

268
00:19:01,921 --> 00:19:03,280
of any climbing surface,

