00:20:31,040 --> 00:20:32,960
But if I take out in the other direction,

288
00:20:32,961 --> 00:20:38,760
it just came off without any high detachment force.

289
00:20:38,761 --> 00:20:41,020
This directionality allows Sticky Bot's feet

290
00:20:41,021 --> 00:20:44,260
to easily attach and detach.

291
00:20:44,261 --> 00:20:48,160
But for now, she can only climb in one direction.

