00:28:02,879 --> 00:28:04,800
This is going to our continuous

404
00:28:04,801 --> 00:28:08,120
extractor for the removal of the rosin and oils.

405
00:28:08,121 --> 00:28:11,440
What you're looking at here is the wood that has

