00:28:19,480 --> 00:28:22,760
This wood will be burned to produce steam and electricity

410
00:28:22,761 --> 00:28:23,980
to power our plants.

411
00:28:25,180 --> 00:28:28,520
Once the rosin is extracted and separated from the solvents,

412
00:28:29,200 --> 00:28:30,220
it's sent to processing,

413
00:28:30,960 --> 00:28:34,560
where it will be converted into whatever form the customer requires.

414
00:28:36,760 --> 00:28:39,040
Rosin proves that with a little innovation,

415
00:28:40,500 --> 00:28:43,940
even the simple tree stump can help hold our world together.

416
00:28:43,941 --> 00:28:49,640
But what about an invisible sticky stuff with hair-raising powers?

