00:31:39,701 --> 00:31:47,440
paper lay it very carefully on top of it now i'd like to use my favorite electrostatic forces to

455
00:31:47,441 --> 00:31:54,340
pull the toner onto the paper and i have charged the paper with the opposite sign is the toner

