00:36:11,481 --> 00:36:14,480
To generate just a year's worth of honey, for example,

519
00:36:14,481 --> 00:36:21,480
requires more than 38 billion bees to fly the equivalent of 1.8 trillion miles

520
00:36:21,481 --> 00:36:23,480
to gather the nectar.

