00:36:45,520 --> 00:36:50,120
Right here is the stuff that we call the propolis, and it's down in these little,

526
00:36:50,121 --> 00:36:56,460
see every crack between the frame and the box is filled up with this big glue, the propolis.

527
00:36:56,461 --> 00:36:57,780
That's plant resin.

528
00:36:58,840 --> 00:37:01,740
You and I fondly refer to it sometimes as pine pitch,

529
00:37:02,060 --> 00:37:03,680
and the bees go out and collect that material.

530
00:37:05,440 --> 00:37:10,020
Once in the hive, the bees combine the tree pitch with wax, oils, and pollen

531
00:37:10,021 --> 00:37:13,260
to create a potent bee formula they use for construction.

532
00:37:15,420 --> 00:37:18,180
They bring it back, and they go into the hive,

533
00:37:18,280 --> 00:37:21,180
and they put it everywhere where there's a little crack.

534
00:37:21,880 --> 00:37:26,140
And they use it to seal the hive so that water can't get into it,

535
00:37:26,141 --> 00:37:28,800
And they also use it, interestingly, as sort of a varnish.

536
00:37:28,940 --> 00:37:30,780
And they varnish the walls of the hive.

537
00:37:30,840 --> 00:37:32,140
They varnish everything inside.

538
00:37:33,340 --> 00:37:35,640
In fact, propolis is such an effective varnish,

539
00:37:36,200 --> 00:37:38,420
the great instrument maker Strativarius used it

540
00:37:38,421 --> 00:37:42,060
as one of his secret ingredients to treat his legendary violins.

541
00:37:45,060 --> 00:37:46,940
But its powers don't end there.

542
00:37:47,760 --> 00:37:49,500
But most importantly to the bees,

543
00:37:49,501 --> 00:37:55,020
the propolis has very, very strong antibiotic abilities.

544
00:37:55,021 --> 00:38:00,740
If you put viruses, bacteria, fungi in contact with it, they'll all be killed.

545
00:38:01,260 --> 00:38:06,700
So the bees are sort of putting an antibiotic throughout the hive.

546
00:38:08,160 --> 00:38:13,500
Combine stickiness with these antibiotic powers, and you have an ideal embalming material,

547
00:38:14,340 --> 00:38:18,380
which the ancient Egyptians first discovered as they mummified their pharaohs,

548
00:38:20,080 --> 00:38:24,760
and which the Soviets mimicked centuries later when they embalmed Vladimir Lenin.

549
00:38:25,020 --> 00:38:30,020
Beekeeping is among the oldest forms of animal husbandry,

