00:39:42,061 --> 00:39:45,620
and synthetic additives, honey remains 100% organic.

575
00:39:46,640 --> 00:39:48,740
Nobody in the lab has been able to reproduce

576
00:39:48,741 --> 00:39:51,580
the 1,800 elements in natural honey.

